{% comment %}
  Renders one line icon from the product-page icon set.

  These are inline rather than files in assets/ for two reasons. Inline SVG can
  inherit `currentColor`, so a single icon works on the light buy box and on the
  beige bands without a second copy; and the product page draws up to a dozen of
  them, which as separate assets would be a dozen extra requests for artwork
  measured in bytes.

  Every path is drawn on a 24x24 grid with `stroke-width: 1.25` and no fill, so
  icons from different groups sit together at the same visual weight. Size and
  colour come from CSS - the svg carries no width/height/color of its own.

  Accepts:
  - icon: {String} icon name. An unknown name renders nothing at all, which is
    deliberate: a missing icon should leave a gap you notice in review, not a
    placeholder box that ships to production.

  Usage:
  {% render 'pdp-icon', icon: 'leaf' %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign i = icon | default: '' | strip
-%}

{%- case i -%}
  {%- comment -%} Natural fabrics - a sprouting leaf pair. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'leaf' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M4 20c0-6.5 4-11.5 11-12.5-.5 7-4.5 11-11 12.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M4 20c2.5-4 5.5-6.5 9-8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <path d="M15 7.5c1.5-2 3.5-3 5.5-3 0 3-1.5 5-4 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Made to order - a hanging garment tag. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'tag' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M7 3.5h7.5L19 8v12.5H7V3.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M14.5 3.5V8H19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M10 12.5h6M10 16h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Gentle on skin - an open palm. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'hand' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M9 11V5.5a1.25 1.25 0 0 1 2.5 0V11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <path d="M11.5 11V4.75a1.25 1.25 0 0 1 2.5 0V11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <path d="M14 11V6.25a1.25 1.25 0 0 1 2.5 0V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <path d="M9 11V9.25a1.25 1.25 0 0 0-2.5 0V15c0 3.3 2.4 5.5 5.5 5.5s5.5-2.2 5.5-5.5v-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Easy exchanges - two arrows chasing a circle. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'exchange' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M20 12a8 8 0 0 1-13.7 5.6M4 12a8 8 0 0 1 13.7-5.6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <path d="M17.5 3v3.5H14M6.5 21v-3.5H10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Light & breathable - a single feather. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'feather' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M17.5 4c-6 0-9.5 4-9.5 9.5 0 1.6.3 3 .9 4.2C12.4 16.4 19 13 19 6.5c0-1-.5-2.5-1.5-2.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M13.5 9 5 20.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Shape without stiffness - a woven grid. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'weave' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M4 8.5h16M4 12h16M4 15.5h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <path d="M8.5 5v14M12 5v14M15.5 5v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Handblock printing - a stamp pressed onto cloth. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'block-print' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <rect x="6" y="4" width="12" height="7" rx="1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
      <path d="M9.5 11v2.5h5V11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M4.5 16.5h15v3.5h-15z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M9.5 7h5M12 5.5v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Product - a folded garment. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'garment' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M9 3.5 4 6v4h2.5v10.5h11V10H20V6l-5-2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M9 3.5a3 3 0 0 0 6 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Process - interlocking loops, a made-to-order cycle. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'process' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="8" cy="9" r="3.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
      <circle cx="16" cy="9" r="3.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
      <circle cx="12" cy="15.5" r="3.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} People - a single figure, head and shoulders. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'person' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
      <path d="M5 20.5c0-3.9 3.1-7 7-7s7 3.1 7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Free shipping - a delivery van. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'truck' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M2.5 6.5h11v9h-11z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M13.5 9.5H17l4 3.5v2.5h-7.5z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <circle cx="7" cy="17.5" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
      <circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} COD - a receipt with a rupee mark. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'receipt' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M5.5 3.5h13v17l-2.2-1.5-2.2 1.5-2.1-1.5-2.2 1.5-2.1-1.5-2.2 1.5z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M9.5 7.5h5M9.5 10.5h5M13 7.5c1.6 0 1.6 3 0 3H9.5l4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Delivery timing - a clock. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'clock' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
      <path d="M12 7v5.2l3.2 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Confirmed pincode - a check inside a circle. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'check-circle' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
      <path d="m8.2 12.2 2.6 2.6 5-5.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} A bare check, for list rows that need no enclosing shape. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'check' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Calendar, for the estimated delivery window. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'calendar' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <rect x="3.5" y="5.5" width="17" height="15" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
      <path d="M3.5 10h17M8 3.5v4M16 3.5v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Instagram, for the size-help contact row. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'instagram' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
      <circle cx="17" cy="7" r="1" fill="currentColor"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} WhatsApp, for the size-help contact row. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'whatsapp' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M3.5 20.5 5 16.2A8.5 8.5 0 1 1 8.3 19.4z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M9 8.5c-.6.6-.6 1.9.4 3.2 1 1.3 2.3 2.1 3.1 2.3.6.1 1.3-.6 1.5-1l1.6.9c-.2.8-1.1 1.6-2.2 1.6-1.9 0-4-1.4-5.3-3.2C7 10.7 6.7 9 7.2 8c.3-.6 1.1-1 1.4-1z" fill="currentColor"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} An arrow for inline "read more" links. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'arrow' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon pdp-icon--arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M4 12h15m0 0-5.5-5.5M19 12l-5.5 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%} Caret for accordion rows. Rotation is CSS, not a second icon. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'caret' -%}
    <svg class="pdp-icon pdp-icon--caret" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>
{%- endcase -%}
